---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Expert Insurance Services | Sherman Oaks Insurance Broker"
  description="Learn about Expert Insurance Services, an independent insurance agency serving individuals, families, and businesses across Sherman Oaks and the San Fernando Valley since 1981."
>

  <Nav />

  <!-- ============================
       PAGE HERO
  ============================= -->
  <section
    class="bg-brand-charcoal text-white py-20 md:py-28"
    style="background-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at 70% 50%, rgba(185,28,28,0.12) 0%, transparent 60%);"
    aria-label="Page header"
  >
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p class="text-brand-red font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Our Story</p>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-white max-w-3xl leading-tight">
        About Expert Insurance Services, Inc.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-gray-300 text-xl max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        A family legacy built on trust, independence, and personal service — serving Southern California since 1981.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================
       COMPANY HISTORY
  ============================= -->
  <section class="bg-brand-cream py-20 md:py-28" aria-labelledby="history-heading">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-14 items-center">

        <!-- Left: Text -->
        <div>
          <p class="text-brand-red font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Our History</p>
          <h2 id="history-heading" class="font-serif text-4xl font-bold text-brand-charcoal mb-6">
            Four Decades of Protecting Families
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              Expert Insurance Services, Inc. was founded in 1981 in Sherman Oaks, California — right in the heart of the San Fernando Valley. From day one, our mission was simple: provide honest, personalized insurance guidance to the families and businesses of Southern California.
            </p>
            <p>
              What started as a small family office has grown into a trusted agency that has served thousands of clients across Southern California over four decades. Our clients aren't just policy numbers — many are multi-generation families who have relied on us through every major life event: buying their first home, insuring their children's cars, protecting their businesses, and planning for the future.
            </p>
            <p>
              As an independent broker, we have always had the freedom to work for our clients — not for any single insurance company. That independence means we can compare rates across multiple top-rated carriers and recommend what genuinely fits your situation, not what's most convenient for us.
            </p>
            <p>
              Today, Expert Insurance Services, Inc. continues to grow, guided by the same values that built it: integrity, loyalty, and a commitment to being there when our clients need us most.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: Timeline milestones -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm p-8 space-y-6">
          <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-brand-charcoal mb-6">Our Journey</h3>

          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-brand-red flex items-center justify-center">
              <span class="font-serif text-white font-bold text-sm leading-tight text-center">1981</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-bold text-brand-charcoal">Founded in Sherman Oaks</h4>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mt-1">The Dardashti family opens Expert Insurance Services, Inc. at 15145 Ventura Blvd, with a commitment to independent, honest service.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="border-l-2 border-gray-100 ml-7 pl-4 h-4"></div>

          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-red-100 flex items-center justify-center">
              <span class="font-serif text-brand-red font-bold text-xs leading-tight text-center">Growth</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-bold text-brand-charcoal">Growth &amp; Expansion</h4>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mt-1">The agency expands its carrier relationships and deepens roots in the Southern California community.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="border-l-2 border-gray-100 ml-7 pl-4 h-4"></div>

          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-red-100 flex items-center justify-center">
              <span class="font-serif text-brand-red font-bold text-xs leading-tight text-center">Today</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-bold text-brand-charcoal">Shawn Dardashti, President</h4>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mt-1">Shawn leads the agency, bringing modern expertise while honoring the tradition of personalized, client-first service.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="border-l-2 border-gray-100 ml-7 pl-4 h-4"></div>

          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-red-50 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-red" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-bold text-brand-charcoal">Today</h4>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mt-1">Serving thousands of Southern California clients with the same independence, honesty, and personal touch the Dardashti family has always stood for.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================
       SHAWN BIO
  ============================= -->
  <section class="bg-white py-20 md:py-28" aria-labelledby="shawn-heading">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-12 items-start">

        <!-- Avatar column -->
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
          <div
            class="w-40 h-40 rounded-full bg-brand-red flex items-center justify-center mb-5 shadow-xl"
            aria-label="Shawn Dardashti"
          >
            <span class="font-serif text-6xl font-bold text-white select-none" aria-hidden="true">SD</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-brand-charcoal">Shawn Dardashti</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-red font-semibold text-sm mt-1">President &amp; Insurance Specialist</p>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mt-1">President &amp; Founder</p>
          <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-3 w-full">
            <a
              href="tel:8189078189"
              class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-brand-red text-white font-semibold px-5 py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-brand-red-dark transition-colors duration-200"
              aria-label="Call Shawn at (818) 907-8189"
            >
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z" />
              </svg>
              (818) 907-8189
            </a>
            <a
              href="mailto:Ex1@sbcglobal.net"
              class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 border-2 border-brand-charcoal text-brand-charcoal font-semibold px-5 py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors duration-200"
            >
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
              </svg>
              Send Email
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Bio text -->
        <div class="md:col-span-2">
          <p class="text-brand-red font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Meet Our Founder</p>
          <h2 id="shawn-heading" class="font-serif text-4xl font-bold text-brand-charcoal mb-6">
            Shawn Dardashti, President
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              Shawn Dardashti grew up watching his family serve the Sherman Oaks community with dedication and integrity. From an early age, he understood that insurance isn't just about policies — it's about people. It's about being there when a family's home is damaged, when a car is totaled, or when a business owner needs guidance they can actually trust.
            </p>
            <p>
              As President and Insurance Specialist at Expert Insurance Services, Inc., Shawn brings both the knowledge and the personal touch that his family has always been known for. He holds the expertise to navigate complex insurance landscapes — from personal auto and homeowners policies to commercial liability and disability coverage — while never losing sight of the individual client in front of him.
            </p>
            <p>
              As an independent broker, Shawn works exclusively for his clients. He is not bound to any single carrier, which means he can objectively compare rates and coverage across Mercury, Travelers, Safeco, Bristol West, Pacific Coastal, and others to find what truly serves your best interests. No quotas. No commissions that skew his recommendations. Just honest guidance.
            </p>
            <p>
              Shawn's clients frequently describe him as responsive, straightforward, and genuinely invested in their well-being. Many have been with the agency for decades — passing the relationship on to their own children, just as the Dardashti family has passed on the business.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================
       VALUES / PILLARS
  ============================= -->
  <section class="bg-brand-cream py-20 md:py-28" aria-labelledby="values-heading">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-14">
        <p class="text-brand-red font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">What We Stand For</p>
        <h2 id="values-heading" class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-charcoal">Our Values</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">

        <!-- Personalized Service -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm border-b-4 border-brand-red">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-red-50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-red" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 6a3.75 3.75 0 11-7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 017.5 0zM4.501 20.118a7.5 7.5 0 0114.998 0A17.933 17.933 0 0112 21.75c-2.676 0-5.216-.584-7.499-1.632z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-brand-charcoal mb-3">Personalized Service</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            Every client is unique. We take the time to understand your specific situation — your family, your assets, your budget — and build coverage that actually makes sense for your life. No cookie-cutter policies. No one-size-fits-all approach.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Independent Choice -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm border-b-4 border-brand-red">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-red-50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-red" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 3v17.25m0 0c-1.472 0-2.882.265-4.185.75M12 20.25c1.472 0 2.882.265 4.185.75M18.75 4.97A48.416 48.416 0 0012 4.5c-2.291 0-4.545.16-6.75.47m13.5 0c1.01.143 2.01.317 3 .52m-3-.52l2.62 10.726c.122.499-.106 1.028-.589 1.202a5.988 5.988 0 01-2.031.352 5.988 5.988 0 01-2.031-.352c-.483-.174-.711-.703-.59-1.202L18.75 4.971zm-16.5.52c.99-.203 1.99-.377 3-.52m0 0l2.62 10.726c.122.499-.106 1.028-.589 1.202a5.989 5.989 0 01-2.031.352 5.989 5.989 0 01-2.031-.352c-.483-.174-.711-.703-.59-1.202L5.25 4.971z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-brand-charcoal mb-3">Independent Choice</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            Being an independent broker means we're on your side — always. We shop the market across multiple top-rated carriers to find you the best combination of coverage, price, and reliability. You deserve options, not a sales pitch.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Family Legacy -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm border-b-4 border-brand-red">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-red-50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-red" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 12l8.954-8.955c.44-.439 1.152-.439 1.591 0L21.75 12M4.5 9.75v10.125c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125H9.75v-4.875c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125V21h4.125c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125V9.75M8.25 21h8.25" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-brand-charcoal mb-3">Family Legacy</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            Founded by Shawn Dardashti in 1981, Expert Insurance Services, Inc. has been proudly serving the community for over four decades. That means a level of accountability and pride you won't find at a call center or big-box broker. Our reputation has been built one relationship at a time.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================
       CONTACT CTA
  ============================= -->
  <section class="bg-brand-charcoal py-16 md:py-20" aria-labelledby="about-cta-heading">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 id="about-cta-heading" class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">
        Ready to Get Started?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
        Call Shawn today for a no-pressure conversation about your insurance needs. As an independent broker, we'll find you the best coverage at the best price.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <a
          href="tel:8189078189"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-brand-red text-white font-bold text-lg px-8 py-4 rounded-lg hover:bg-brand-red-dark transition-colors duration-200"
          aria-label="Call (818) 907-8189"
        >
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z" />
          </svg>
          Call: (818) 907-8189
        </a>
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 border-2 border-white text-white font-bold text-base px-8 py-4 rounded-lg hover:bg-white hover:text-brand-charcoal transition-colors duration-200"
        >
          View Contact Info
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />

</Layout>
